{"title":"2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 11","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems (page does not exist)\">2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) #11</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems (page does not exist)\">2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) #14</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What number goes in the box so that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/4/964b6f4470eaa4b13087e7521826e9098470a991.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{28}{32} + \\frac{1}{\\Box} = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"97\" height=\"38\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/2/a621cc7c57f4b1434a420da44b3279e134d9ff1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 24 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ -3 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 7 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 16 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"391\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can first realize that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/9/b099d139db99c17c357195aad4a2ee3228b69d30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{28}{32} = \\frac{28 \\div 4}{32 \\div 4} = \\frac{7}{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"139\" height=\"40\" />.\n</p><p>Thus, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/7/6573bb5a5f28e2438dbac1d0db3cefa3ca7e7506.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{7}{8} + \\frac{1}{\\Box} = 1 = \\frac{8}{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"125\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/9/8a979f3ad2ddfa970ae2b0893fd492008f8c1ea4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{\\Box} = \\frac{8}{8} - \\frac{7}{8} = \\frac{1}{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"129\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>We can notice that this only occurs when the denominators are equal to each other because the numerators are equal.\n</p><p>Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/f/8cf8c1eba698938bafba8ff20cc4ff788ce6487a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Box = \\boxed {\\textbf {(E) } 8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"94\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)\" title=\"2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)\">2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Ga